        <h2 id="inside">What calculators does Best Answer Hub include?</h2>
        <p>The calculators fall into five families: academic and grades, statistics, STEM and math, converters, and work and tech. Each family below links straight to its tools, so you can jump to the exact calculator you need.</p>
