            <tr><td class="band">STEM &amp; math suite</td><td><a href="/calculators/stem-suite/">STEM Suite</a>: <a href="/calculators/stem-suite/matrix-calculator/">Matrix</a>, <a href="/calculators/stem-suite/resistor-color-code-calculator/">Resistor Color Code</a>, <a href="/calculators/stem-suite/molecular-weight-calculator/">Molecular Weight</a>, <a href="/calculators/stem-suite/truth-table-generator/">Truth Table</a>, <a href="/calculators/stem-suite/number-base-converter/">Number Base</a>, <a href="/calculators/stem-suite/normal-distribution-calculator/">Normal Distribution</a></td><td>Engineering, chemistry, computer science, and math homework</td></tr>
