          <li>US Federal Trade Commission, <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/reports/look-behind-screens-examining-data-practices-social-media-video-streaming-services" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">A Look Behind the Screens</a>, 2024 ("vast surveillance"; data-minimisation practices "woefully inadequate").</li>
          <li>NIST, <a href="https://www.nist.gov/privacy-framework" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Framework</a> (CT.DP-P1: data actions taking place on local devices limit observability and linkability).</li>
